<title>UK: DG Hypo adds 500 million marks to April 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>DG Hypo adds 500 million marks to April 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and DG Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    17.ARP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6	   SELL CONC  16.5	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 760.</p>
<p>	    **TO BE PRICED SIX BP OVER SERIES 118 BOBL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
